OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FJersey's young swimming sensation
OL,7,FFilip Nowacki might be comparatively
OL,8,Fsmall in stature, but he is already
OL,9,Fmaking a big mark on the international
OL,10,Fstage.
OL,12,FAppearing in his first Commonwealth
OL,13,FGames, the 18-year-old's gold and
OL,14,Fsilver medal haul from Glasgow sees
OL,15,Fhim become the island's most decorated
OL,16,Fathlete in the competition.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/9
