FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FMentored by the triple British Olympic
OL,7,Fchampion Adam Ramsay-Peaty, whom
OL,8,FNowacki beat to claim second place in
OL,9,Fthe 100m breaststroke on Sunday before
OL,10,Fthe Jerseyman's golden performance in
OL,11,Fthe 200m, many are now tipping the
OL,12,Fteenager for further greatness.
OL,14,FNowacki's success has seen him hit
OL,15,Fnational headlines and receive praise
OL,16,Ffrom far and wide.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FThe 200m breaststroke Commonwealth
OL,7,FGames record holder Ross Murdoch, co-
OL,8,Fcommentating on BBC Radio 5 Live,
OL,9,Fstated: "An absolutely historic gold
OL,10,Fmedal for Jersey and Filip, a
OL,11,Fphenomenal swim.
OL,13,F"For 18 years old, to turn up at your
OL,14,Ffirst senior meet really and lead from
OL,15,Fthe front, what an inspiration to
OL,16,Fother swimmers.
OL,18,F"He is going to be a huge name in the
OL,19,Fnext two years looking towards the LA
OL,20,F(Olympic) Games for sure."
OL,26,@|D@Apm|D@Ipn
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31304
