CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FJersey's Chief Minister, Senator
OL,7,FLyndon Farnham, called it "an
OL,8,Fincredible achievement that reflects
OL,9,Fyears of hard work, dedication and
OL,10,Fdetermination".
OL,12,FMeanwhile, TNT Sports Presenter Becky
OL,13,FIves beamed: "Oh I'm sure in years to
OL,14,Fcome there will be a statue of Filip
OL,15,FNowacki somewhere in Jersey."
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G4/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FDuring the broadcaster's coverage, the
OL,7,FOlympic breaststroker silver medallist
OL,8,FMichael Jamieson added: "It's very
OL,9,Frare that you have a 200m swimmer with
OL,10,Fso much natural speed, especially as
OL,11,Fhe's not the biggest or most physical
OL,12,Fathlete but his timing, precision and
OL,13,Ftechnique is world class."
OL,15,FSpeaking to ITV Channel in May, Ramsay-
OL,16,FPeaty, who is widely regarded as the
OL,17,Fbest breaststroker of all time,
OL,18,Fdescribed Nowacki as a "very
OL,19,Fimpressive young man".
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G5/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FHe added: "He's got a lot of talent
OL,7,Fand the runway for him is one of those
OL,8,Fthings we don't know because he's
OL,9,Falready so fast, especially over the
OL,10,F200 metres.
OL,12,F"I think he'll naturally progress into
OL,13,Fthat thinking of bringing back gold
OL,14,Fmedals and also potentially world
OL,15,Frecords."
OL,17,FWhile the pair compete in the same
OL,18,Fevent, Ramsay-Peaty explained that
OL,19,Fthey have opposing styles.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G6/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31307
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,FHe said: "He is obviously a lot
OL,7,Flighter than me, I carry a lot more
OL,8,Fmuscle. I'm a power athlete, whereas
OL,9,Fhe can rely on that endurance aspect
OL,10,Fquite a lot more.
OL,12,F"We have two very different strokes,
OL,13,FI'm quite high in the water, he's more
OL,14,Fforward but both are proven to be very
OL,15,Ffast.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G7/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
OL,24,ANext Page BNat Sport CNat Radio FRewind
FL,314,300,200,120,000,100
PN,31308
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F313A1785784698
OL,3,CCould Jersey teenager Filip Nowacki be
OL,4,Cthe next Adam Peaty?
OL,6,F"He's maximising that ability with the
OL,7,Fbody shape he's got. As teenagers
OL,8,Fbecome young adults and men, he'll
OL,9,Fhave to gain a little bit more muscle
OL,10,Fif he wants to be quicker down the
OL,11,Ffront 50 but without compromising the
OL,12,F200.
OL,14,F"It's one of those strokes that
OL,15,Frequires the perfect amount of
OL,16,Fcomposure, balance and being mature
OL,17,Fenough to hold back a little as well,
OL,18,Fbe a bit more strategic and tactical.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G8/9
OL,2,W,.!/  +.!/*%*%R,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,RpppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/sport
